$CATEGORY: Vocabulary/HansenQuinn/2.2

::Q001::[markdown]λύω:{
	~%-100%have come#Incorrect. **ἥκω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἥκω** “have come” (Chapter 8).
	~%-100%do#Incorrect. **πράττω** is Principal Part 1 of **πράττω** “do” (Chapter 5).
	~%50%free#Correct: **λύω** is Principal Part 1 of **λύω** “free” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%be spoken of#Incorrect. **ἀκούω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἀκούω** “be spoken of” (Chapter 11).
	~%50%unbind#Correct: **λύω** is Principal Part 1 of **λύω** “unbind” (Chapter 2).
}


::Q002::[markdown]μέν… δέ (postpos. conjs.):{
	~%-100%conditional#Incorrect. **ἄν** means “conditional” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%all the same#Incorrect. **ὅμως** means “all the same” (Chapter 8).
	~%-100%for the sake of#Incorrect. **χάριν** means “for the sake of” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%introduces a question#Incorrect. **ἆρα** means “introduces a question” (Chapter 2).
	~%100%on the one hand… on the other hand#Correct: **μέν… δέ (postpos. conjs.)** → “on the one hand… on the other hand” (Chapter 2).
}


